- Power/network: S1 mains + stable network; S2 battery kit + offline storage; S3 mains + offline storage (network intermittent irrelevant). Data retrieval at closeout, mid-point check S2.
- Uncertainty: working target ±3. Reference evidence: bench max |error| 0.9 at 45/75/90/95; supports but not proves. Pre-deployment and field verification must demonstrate site-specific bias/uncertainty ≤3. If not, do not deploy or adjust method? If after deployment, flag and don't claim R3.
